      "statusChangeNewStatus": "in progress",
      "value": "Yep, this was an issue we've had for a long time actually (hand controllers have always been affected too) stemming from some OpenVR backend stuff. I've poked around at it and already have a functioning fix that will be making it into the next open beta patch. (So bonus, you'll finally have textures on hand controllers as well)",
