  "details": "# Issue:\nRight now when using the System / SteamVR Tracker model they default to a black texture. This makes them really hard to see and if SteamVR Tracker model has a different color, like white for example, it can be a bit confusing for the end user.\n# Suggestion:\nAlso use the provided Textures and not just the 3D Model.\n# Attachments:\nHere you can see that on my Vive 2.0 Tracker the tracking dots are missing as well as the white blue Vive Logo:",
